# NetBoost: allow the root daemon to look up telephony services via
# servicemanager (dumpsys telephony.registry / phone). On some HyperOS
# sepolicy profiles the su/magisk domains lack service_manager find for
# radio_service, which makes the lingxi engine blind while the same
# dumpsys call works from the manager's exec context.
allow su radio_service service_manager find
allow magisk radio_service service_manager find
allow su servicemanager binder call
allow su servicemanager binder transfer
allow su servicemanager service_manager list
allow magisk servicemanager binder call
allow magisk servicemanager binder transfer
allow magisk servicemanager service_manager list
